Privacy Policy for NESgfx

Effective date: 27/08/2026

CHREditor is a paid macOS application developed by Jonatan Yde ("I", "me"). This policy explains how the app handles your data.

Data collection

CHREditor does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. The app has no analytics, no advertising, no tracking, and no backend servers. All files you create or edit stay on your own device.

Network access

The app does not connect to the internet or send any information anywhere.

Crash reports

If you have enabled "Share with App Developers" in macOS (System Settings → Privacy & Security → Analytics & Improvements), Apple may send me aggregated, anonymized crash statistics through Apple's systems. This is controlled entirely by Apple and your macOS settings, contains no personal information, and can be turned off at any time in that same settings pane. I do not receive any data that identifies you.

Children's privacy

The app is safe for all ages. Since it collects no data, it collects nothing from children.

Your rights (GDPR)

As I hold no data about you, there is nothing to access, correct, or delete. If you have questions about privacy, you can contact me at info@codeninja.dk. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Danish Data Protection Agency (Datatilsynet, datatilsynet.dk).

